P.push(page({ toc: '42 · Sound & 3D', sec: '42 · Sound & 3D', title: 'Optional sound and 3D language', body: `<div class="cols2"><div><h4>Sound (optional, never part of the identity)</h4><table class="t small"><tr><th>Cue</th><th>Character</th></tr><tr><td>Silk Glide</td><td>Refined fabric glide as the ribbon enters</td></tr><tr><td>Stone Resonance</td><td>Soft felt-mallet resonance in a stone space as the logo settles</td></tr><tr><td>Lumen Shimmer</td><td>Two delicate glints at the Lumen ignition</td></tr></table><p class="small">Intro and outro beds sit at −23 / −24 LUFS with a true peak of −3 dB. No whooshes, trailer hits or bass drops. Every visual works muted.</p></div><div><h4>3D / CGI</h4><p class="small">The objects are the silk ribbon, silk plane, silk wrap, architectural monolith, Portal, and the Lumen as a light source. The hero material is SIRAJ Silk: base #602733, sheen tinted #C79A9C, anisotropy 0.6. Use matte stone and bronze glass. Never chrome or gold.</p>${img(still('Wrap', '4x5'), 'height:420px;object-fit:cover')}</div></div>` }));

